:Namespace GameState
    ⎕IO ⎕ML←1
    
    ⍝ These are the indices used for the game state vector.
    ⍝ The goal is to keep the representation slim so that move generation does not occupy as much memory.

    side←1
    castling_rights←1+⍳4
    en_passant_square←6
    halfmove←7
    fullmove←8
    max_index←⌈/∊side castling_rights en_passant_square halfmove fullmove

    init←{
        ⍝ Initialize a game state vector.
        ⍝ ⍵ ←→
        ⍝ ← ←→
        game_state←max_index⍴0
        game_state[∊side castling_rights en_passant_square halfmove fullmove]←∊⍵ ⎕VGET 'side' 'castling_rights'  'en_passant_square' 'halfmove' 'fullmove'
        game_state
    }

:EndNamespace
